Chocolatez and BrickTower

Music:
Chocolatez



1 bit tileset from Teaceratops
https://teaceratops.itch.io/1-bit-tileset

Fonts Used (licensed under OpenFontLicense):
GeistPixel - Regular
PixelifySans - VariableFont

Camera shake code from Jason McCollum
https://shaggydev.com/2022/02/23/screen-shake-godot/

Final boss SFX taken from Freesound:
https://freesound.org/people/TheKingOfGeeks360/sounds/861149/

And a thank you to GMTK for making me productive once a year!! Yippee!!


"

